# =====================================================================
# COLECCION DE PRUEBAS HTTP - SAAS CONTABLE UNIPUTUMAYO (SALA 121)
# Requiere la extension "REST Client" (Huachao Mao) en VS Code
# =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@mockUrl = http://localhost:3001

### 1. Autenticacion de Usuario (Login)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ferreputumayo.co",
  "password": "Password123*"
}

### Extraer Token
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Consultar Catalogo de Productos (Inventario)
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Venta Mostrador POS en Efectivo (Liquidacion)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pos/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Idempotency-Key: a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "paymentMethod": "EFECTIVO",
  "cashTendered": 100000,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 32000,
      "taxRate": 0.19
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Consultar Cartera de Fiados
GET {{baseUrl}}/credits/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Registrar Abono a Fiado de Cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/credits/customers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50000,
  "paymentMethod": "EFECTIVO"
}

### 6. Consultar Balance General
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounting/reports/balance-sheet?cutOffDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
